    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, so i had the flu like 3 weeks ago and i thought i was better but i've been feeling really wiped out lately. like super exhausted. also whenever i try to walk up the stairs or do anything active my heart starts racing really fast and i feel like i can't catch my breath. my chest feels kind of heavy too but it's not like sharp pain. is this just normal post-flu fatigue or should i be worried?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
