    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you but i really just want to try and fix it myself first before i spend hundreds on an ER visit or a doctor. like if i just took a big dose of magnesium and maybe some extra electrolytes and just rested for a few days, wouldn't that usually fix stuff like this? i'm pretty sure i'm just run down from the virus. can't i just try a high dose of something to see if it helps the heart thing settle down first?",
